=2 Notes
* To save time, you can bring a {i:Demon Pen|Demon Pen|1653} when you travel to start this quest.

=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Koblakiq} to begin this quest.
** Make sure you have zoned after completing the previous quest.
* Head to {z:Castle Zvahl Baileys} and fight {m:Blood Demons|Blood Demon} and {m:Demon Generals|Demon General} until you obtain a {i:Demon Pen|Demon Pen|1653}.
* Trade the {i:Demon Pen|Demon Pen|1653} to {n:Koblakiq}.
* Wait 1 earth minute, then speak to {n:Koblakiq} again.
* Return to {z:Castle Zvahl Baileys} and check the **???** at (I-8 behind the gate where {m:Dark Spark} spawns) to spawn {m:Marquis Andrealphus}, {m:Demon Banneret} x2, {m:Demon Secretary} x2.
** Any demons near by will link with the NM's.
** Only {m:Marquis Andrealphus} needs to be killed to proceed. After defeating him, any additional spawned demons will immediately die, but not any linked demons.
** {m:Demon Bannerets|Demon Banneret} and the {m:Demon Secretarys|Demon Secretary} can be slept.
** {m:Marquis Andrealphus} has the ability to {s:Escape} whoever has hate out of the castle and back into {z:Xarcabard}.
*** He will not be able to cast {s:Escape} if there is only 1 party member left in the zone, or you are soloing him.
* Examine the **???** again after {m:Marquis Andrealphus} is defeated to obtain {k:Zeelozok's earplug}.
* Return to {n:Koblakiq} to complete this quest.

